/-!
# A181118

Sequencing of all rational numbers p/q > 0 as ordered pairs (p,q). The rational (p,q) occurs as the n-th ordered pair where n=(p+q-1)*(p+q-2)/2+q.

The 105 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A181118

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 2,
    1, 3, 4, 1, 3, 2, 2, 3, 1, 4,
    5, 1, 4, 2, 3, 3, 2, 4, 1, 5,
    6, 1, 5, 2, 4, 3, 3, 4, 2, 5,
    1, 6, 7, 1, 6, 2, 5, 3, 4, 4,
